{"@context":["https://litlfred.github.io/folio-assistant/ns/content/v1.jsonld",{"@base":"https://litlfred.github.io/folio/","folio-assistant-sci":"https://litlfred.github.io/folio-assistant-sci/v0/ns/"}],"@id":"papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/lem-brings-euler-characteristic","@type":["folio-assistant-sci:Lemma","doco:Section"],"label":"lem:brings-euler-characteristic","kind":"lemma","title":"Euler characteristic of Bring's surface","uses":["papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/prop-euler-char-stability","papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/rem-hkr-theorem"],"foreshadows":["papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/rem-three-euler-characteristics","papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/rem-euler-characteristic-of-the-regular-representation"],"proofs":["papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/prf-brings-euler-characteristic"],"tags":["euler-characteristic","brings-surface","categorical-trace","descartes-substrate"],"leanRef":"qou:QOU.ArchimedeanUniverse.brings_euler_characteristic","text":"brings-euler-characteristic.md","provenance":"authored","html":"<a id=\"lem:brings-euler-characteristic\"></a><p><em>Bring's surface <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\Sigma_4</code> has topological Euler characteristic</em></p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-math math-display\">  \\chi_{\\mathrm{eu}}(\\Sigma_4) = 2 - 2g(\\Sigma_4) = 2 - 8 = -6 .</code></pre>\n<p><em>Equivalently, in the Hodge decomposition of its Hochschild homology (<a href=\"#rem:hkr-theorem\" data-at=\"lifting-and-descent/yekutieli-lifting-kummer-motivic\">HKR</a>) one has <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\dim HH_0(\\Sigma_4) = 2</code> and <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\dim HH_{\\pm 1}(\\Sigma_4) = 4</code>, and <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">-6</code> is the alternating sum <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\sum_n (-1)^n \\dim HH_n(\\Sigma_4)</code>.</em></p>\n<p>This is an invariant of the base curve of the archimedean realisation, not of the substrate object <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">A</code>.</p>\n","source":"folio/quantum-observable-universe/brings-surface/brings-euler-characteristic.md","heading":"Lemma","number":"8.4.7","page":"b/lem-brings-euler-characteristic","qa":{"counts":{"pass":98,"fail":0,"warn":0,"na":17,"unknown":0,"stale":89},"milnor":{"total":3,"notPassing":0}},"lean":{"expected":true,"ref":"qou:QOU.MassTheory.brings_euler_characteristic","via":"ref","path":"folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MassTheory/brings_euler_characteristic.lean","compiles":"unchecked","sorry":false,"sorryBasis":"text"}}
